OL,3,GNEWSAFirst new Mersey ferry in 60 years
OL,4,Aofficially launched
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first new Mersey Ferry to be built
OL,7,Fin 60 years has been officially
OL,8,Flaunched in Liverpool.
OL,10,FThe #26m Royal Daffodil has been made
OL,11,Fby Birkenhead-based shipbuilder Cammell
OL,12,FLaird for the Liverpool City Region
OL,13,FCombined Authority.
OL,15,FMayor Steve Rotheram told BBC Breakfast
OL,16,Fthe ferry was "the last piece in the
OL,17,Fjigsaw" in his city region's public
OL,18,Ftransport overhaul.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
