OL,3,GNEWSAFirst new Mersey ferry in 60 years
OL,4,Aofficially launched
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor and singer Claire Sweeney said it
OL,7,Fwas "one of the greatest honours" of
OL,8,Fher career to have been asked to host
OL,9,Fthe Pier Head launch ceremony.
